{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB小花何依婷（Regina）自2023年年底與富二代男友Cedric在峇里島舉行婚禮後，正式榮升人妻，2024年12月宣布懷孕喜訊，去年4月順利誕下一女，一家三口幸福美滿。婚後榮升富貴人妻的何依婷，不時出席社交盛會，日前她與老公一起出席「香港馬主協會（The Hong Kong Racehorse Owners Association）2026周年晚宴（Annual Dinner）」，更自爆幸運抽中大獎名錶，手氣極旺！</p><figure><img alt=\"2023年年底舉行婚禮。（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241022/925393201072705536473198.jpeg/4gb0VB3iGPJC_x1vPiCgUAbC1uLbrhKQw7jLqsO4y6o\"/><figcaption>2023年年底舉行婚禮。（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬小蠻腰！（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260321/1112044103786434560470215.jpeg/IvZiQt12sbnqD7iY5vhEaqOxgTv_fppvPA8HPzwPBz8\"/><figcaption>大曬小蠻腰！（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家三口好幸福！（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137094049069666304524963.jpeg/BnkNWzjSoHRX4f-KkcaNHNl6YpPSywIqUlU9WlJVPVo\"/><figcaption>一家三口好幸福！（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"《愛・回家之三代同糖》。（公關提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261106/1195447843947548672319785.jpeg/KQIqqMTexzbasL4L4bbG8gWqP1X2LkmAz_9bIc__WyE\"/><figcaption>《愛・回家之三代同糖》。（公關提供）</figcaption></figure><p>何依婷一身名牌出席晚宴　大騷長腿激讚老公攝影技術：有2米高</p><p>何依婷在社交平台分享靚相，相中所見，她身穿黑色超短連身裙外搭黑色「小香風」外套，胸前與腰間均綴有醒目的Chanel雙C金屬標誌，手拎黑色Hermès Mini Kelly名牌手袋，配搭銀色水鑽蝴蝶結高踭鞋，大騷白滑長腿，散發出貴氣名媛氣質。何依婷更留言大讚老公：「已經成功訓練到我老公影相影出嚟有2米高🤣」，字裏行間都可見夫妻間的甜蜜恩愛互動。</p><figure><img alt=\"何依婷一身名牌，大曬Chanel加Hermès富貴行頭。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196897884583497728071438.png/24Wy0z3KNOQFBh4q5KtzAee42vMOK5Wi0ts3lNLbN5Q\"/><figcaption>何依婷一身名牌，大曬Chanel加Hermès富貴行頭。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"自爆抽中大獎鑽石名錶手氣極旺。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196897882221973504319827.png/g0ZI36g5xMzg3wpk6CXSyPW92aWIcvCCyx6bkssem5I\"/><figcaption>自爆抽中大獎鑽石名錶手氣極旺。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>何依婷抽中大獎鑽石名錶手氣極旺　閃嫁富二代進駐三千萬豪宅</p><p>除了以超Fit狀態驚艷亮相之外，何依婷當晚更抽中大獎，她興奮曬出獎品並寫道：「重點我今晚抽到大獎～好開心呀❤️」只見黑色錶盒中裝有一隻鑲滿璀璨鑽石的六時區（多時區）酒桶形名貴腕錶，設計極具個性！何依婷在2017年參選港姐奪得亞軍後入行，曾參演不少劇集，2023年年底閃婚後生活質素幾級跳，據知何依婷老公Cedric是富二代，從事物流業，她曾透露兩人是在大學時認識，而何依婷婚後生活亦愈來愈富貴，不但行頭大升級周身名牌，更搬入有「紅磡樓王」之稱的海名軒約3,000萬元單位，大廳空間極大，採光充足，十分開揚！</p><figure><img alt=\"據知何依婷老公Cedric是富二代，從事物流業，她曾透露兩人是在大學時認識。（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250125/959945484867473408058746.jpeg/x3UkzBFY2ndGgat_4Ev72WH-0f5bHJDofM7lEnzO5RI\"/><figcaption>據知何依婷老公Cedric是富二代，從事物流業，她曾透露兩人是在大學時認識。（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"慶祝生日！（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137094051582185472063748.jpeg/UY9RgoJwSEJZtUX6Q-Vr7OBGYobxHDnd_PVIpvz1SKY\"/><figcaption>慶祝生日！（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"古裝扮相。（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196897879256469504714523.jpeg/9fCdIZ0HoICRASHs-3lf0f8sT2MFdA_ZcrUzR3K1M0c\"/><figcaption>古裝扮相。（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"住有「紅磡樓王」之稱的海名軒。（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250125/959945487350632448490861.jpeg/V6Lz--fFN0IgE-RMZY8SXlANlKmmujCkUVSMSVFUjEk\"/><figcaption>住有「紅磡樓王」之稱的海名軒。（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"採光充足！（IG@reginahyt）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260317/1110620441711480832296138.jpeg/8hkKkNM_6MX2uGlnNH_CNHLozfoMVV2gvSw76L0sO-g\"/><figcaption>採光充足！（IG@reginahyt）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T00:52:51.801788+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":989,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T00:30:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T03:28:22.340066+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T00:46:17.005151+00:00","content_hash":"05a3ea49086e7eddf41eeae6bb9d69abb7a4b87979961796e88949a2ec47554d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}